  "meta": {
    "status": "live",
    "notes": "One traversal from Industrial Way west along Mount Solo Road, east on Ocean Beach Highway and south on 38th Avenue, finishing before the Industrial Way junction. OSM reference fetched 2026-10-15. This is a simplified arcade course, not a survey of present turn restrictions or lane widths: drive lanes are widened to 4 m, unsurveyed medians omitted, and ordinary side streets are scenery rather than playable connections. No port-internal roads, lake trails, civic ground or repeated laps. Reuses PNW industrial, forest and town dressing rather than reproducing individual properties."
  }
